OpenCloud provider: logo notice

The path data in assets/buttonlogo.svg, assets/buttonlogo_dark.svg, assets/listicon.svg
and assets/listicon_dark.svg comes from the OpenCloud logo:

- services/web/assets/themes/opencloud/assets/logo.svg in
  https://github.com/opencloud-eu/opencloud (commit 93fb9cbf6c), Apache License 2.0
- common/loginpage/providers/opencloud/assets in
  https://github.com/Euro-Office/desktop-apps (commit 5e84fcb25, "feat: add OpenCloud
  connection provider"), which ships the same artwork

The files here re-frame that artwork for the openWorkspace provider's canvas sizes and
restore the "l" bar of the wordmark that the desktop-apps copy leaves out. The shapes are
unchanged.

OpenCloud and the OpenCloud logo are trademarks of their owner. They are used here only
to name the servers this provider connects to. The Apache License 2.0 grants no rights to
trade names or trademarks (section 6), and the CC BY-SA 4.0 notice that desktop-apps
applies to its GUI assets does not cover this logo.
